Enhanced grass atlas
===================

The blade, tuft, weed and small-flower atlas generated by
crates/ao-render/src/grass_atlas.rs is original procedural artwork authored for
this project. It is generated entirely from mathematical shapes in source code;
no external images, models, Funcom artwork or extracted game assets are included
in this atlas. It is distributed under the same terms as the project source.

The atlas is used only by the optional Enhanced ground-grass renderer. Native
terrain samples are evaluated at runtime solely to blend the new vegetation
with the installed scene; they are not copied into the generated atlas.

Soft sun-shadow filter
======================

The blocker-search and Vogel-disk penumbra filter in
crates/ao-render/src/sun_shadows.wgsl follows the algorithm of
`CascadeVisibility` in ao-vk (https://github.com/wannabuh/ao-vk,
rvk/shaders/ffp_main.glsl), MIT licensed. The WGSL is an independent
reimplementation of the algorithm, not copied source.

HDR tonemap, grade and dither
=============================

The highlight knee, sunlit-warm / shade-cool chroma grade and interleaved-gradient
dither in crates/ao-render/src/grade.wgsl follow the approach of `tonemap.frag`
(`Grade()`, `Dither8`) in ao-vk (https://github.com/wannabuh/ao-vk), MIT licensed.
The WGSL is an independent reimplementation: the tone curve, the luminance-preserving
grade and the sun-weight gating are original to this project.
